    <section class="empire-glance" id="at-a-glance" aria-labelledby="glance-title">
      <div class="empire-glance-main"><h2 class="empire-glance-title" id="glance-title">At a glance</h2><ul><li>A totalitarian dictatorship under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/adolf-hitler">Adolf Hitler</a> that replaced the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/weimar-republic">Weimar Republic</a> within months of January 1933.</li><li>It rearmed, annexed <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sudetenland">Sudetenland</a>, and launched the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/second-world-war">Second World War</a> by invading <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/poland">Poland</a> in 1939.</li><li>It murdered some six million <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jews">Jews</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/holocaust">Holocaust</a> and was destroyed by total military defeat in May 1945.</li></ul></div>
      <aside class="empire-dyk"><p class="empire-dyk-title">Did you know?</p><p><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/adolf-hitler">Hitler</a> never formally abolished the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/weimar">Weimar</a> constitution: the Enabling Act of 1933 was renewed by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/reichstag">Reichstag</a> in 1937 and 1939 and extended by decree in 1943.</p></aside>
    </section>

